  "summary": "binwalk vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that the PFS extractor in Binwalk did not properly\nsanitize file paths. If a user or automated system were tricked into\nextracting a specially crafted PFS file system image, an attacker could\npossibly use this issue to write arbitrary files and execute arbitrary\ncode.",
